From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mscoree: runtime state, loaded runtimes, domain calls (3597)

mscoree: runtime state queries, loaded-runtime enumeration, domain calls

ICLRRuntimeInfo::IsLoaded, IsLoadable, IsStarted, Get/SetDefaultStartupFlags
and BindAsLegacyV2Runtime keep real state; ICLRMetaHost::EnumerateLoadedRuntimes
and GetVersionFromProcess report the runtime hosted in the current process.
ICorRuntimeHost: Stop, CurrentDomain, CreateEvidence, EnumDomains/NextDomain/
CloseEnum. ICLRRuntimeHost: Stop, GetCurrentAppDomainId, ExecuteInAppDomain.

Rebased at integration (integ-2026-10) onto 3320 (fast-a): CreateEvidence body from 3597 followed by 3320's UnloadDomainId/get_domain_id helpers; 3320's host-control block kept after CLRRuntimeHost_Stop (3597's Stop body kept).
---
